  ('m', 'Which sentence does NOT belong in a paragraph about holiday benefits?', ['Holidays reduce stress.', 'Families spend time together.', 'My cousin is good at maths.', 'People return to work refreshed.'], 'C', 'It does not support the topic: it breaks unity.'),
  ('m', 'Which linker best begins the final paragraph?', ['Firstly', 'For example', 'In conclusion', 'Then'], 'C', 'In conclusion introduces the end.'),
  ('m', 'Supporting sentences mainly', ['repeat the title', 'give reasons and examples', 'start a new topic', 'end the essay'], 'B', 'They develop the topic sentence.'),
  ('m', 'Putting events in the order they happened gives the paragraph', ['unity', 'chronological coherence', 'a title', 'a topic'], 'B', 'Time order makes ideas coherent.'),
